    <interviewLabel>RES Quote Before Save Sync Validation {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>RES Quote Before Save Sync Validation</label>
    <description>Blocks a Quote from becoming the syncing (primary) quote on its Opportunity when: (1) its Status is Cancelled or Expired, (2) another Quote on the same Opportunity is already syncing, or (3) another Quote on the same Opportunity already has a Hard Blocked unit on one of its line items. RM must cancel the currently syncing/hard-blocked quote before syncing another. Also blocks a Quote's Status from being set to Customer Approved unless it is already the syncing quote. Runs before-save so the record is never committed with an invalid sync/approval state.</description>
    <processMetadataValues>
